    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AUTHORIZES THE ACCEPTANCE OF A DONATION OF THREE PIERCE FIRE ENGINES FROM THE HONOLULU FIRE DEPARTMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The donation from Honolulu Fire Department, with an estimated value of $135,000, would be utilized in the Hawai‘i Fire Department’s reserve fleet of engines.&lt;/p&gt;
